Spec: Durable mobile owner decisions

Purpose:
  Persist an owner operation before mutation and recover its original outcome without replay.

Owns:
  ./OwnerActions.java

Must:
  Write and synchronize a private intent before each review or access/peer decision.
  Block new owner mutations while a previous unknown outcome remains pending.
  Match retained result identity to the original subject before confirmation; abandonment requires a fresh unknown query.
  Never store device private keys, certificates, addresses or application payload in receipts.
